-- population-taxonomy content under CLAUDE.md section 8's owner-sign-off list. This ruling
-- is that sign-off, and it supersedes that refusal on contact (rule 0).
--
-- EVERY MAPPING IS DERIVED, NOT ASSUMED (rule 8). Six of the seven are recorded in the base
-- stage's own `populations.description` text -- 'Was UPL.', 'Was VIS.', 'Merges
-- OFS+CFS+MCAS+POTS (+LCOV)' -- which is the base layer doing exactly what CLAUDE.md
